From 7e4f9f3927c1e42c87116f815aa350a1da6373fe Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Bryan Sandoz <17123735+skyclmbr@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 30 Apr 2026 22:04:44 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 03/23] feat(vr): Phase 1 OpenXR stereo demo (triangle)

Add VRManager with Win32 OpenGL session, stage/view spaces, stereo swapchains, and per-eye triangle render. Fetch Khronos OpenXR-SDK by default; optional FindOpenXR via -DVSP_VR_SYSTEM_OPENXR=ON. Scope MSVC /MP to C/CXX only so nested OpenXR loader.rc builds. RunVRMode creates a hidden GL 3.3 context and drives the XR frame loop.

